# The published Giano packages live on GitHub Packages (README "Releases"). Only the reference dApp
# (services/custom-example) installs one from there; every other workspace package links its
# siblings. GitHub Packages refuses anonymous reads, so the token stays out of this file: put
# `//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=<PAT with read:packages>` in ~/.npmrc.
@appliedblockchain:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
